      nursingEssentials: ["Confirm diabetes stage with autoantibodies and dysglycemia or recent stage-3 criteria, age, infection/vaccine status, CBC, liver tests and pregnancy plan before treatment; premedicate as ordered.", "Monitor temperature, blood pressure, symptoms, CBC and liver tests during the course. Teach that hyperglycemia symptoms still require urgent testing and that delayed progression is not immunity from future diabetes."],
      keyLabs: ["Islet autoantibodies, glucose/OGTT and A1c or C-peptide as appropriate, CBC with lymphocytes/neutrophils, AST/ALT/bilirubin, EBV/CMV testing, infection screening and pregnancy assessment."],
