      nclexTraps: ["Generalized lipodystrophy is a lack-of-functional-adipose/leptin disorder despite severe metabolic disease; metreleptin is replacement, not routine obesity treatment.", "Severe infection or worsening control may signal neutralizing antibodies and requires testing, not automatic dose escalation."],
