      nursingEssentials: ["Verify age, open epiphyses, weight, renal function, weekly day, vial strength, reconstitution volume and trained caregiver technique; recalculate as weight changes.", "A dose may be given within the labeled two-day window around the scheduled day; otherwise follow missed-dose rules rather than bunching injections. Continue full achondroplasia surveillance."],
