      description: "Bempedoic acid is an oral prodrug-like ATP-citrate-lyase inhibitor that lowers hepatic cholesterol synthesis one enzymatic step upstream of HMG-CoA reductase. Liver-enriched ACSVL1 activates it to a CoA thioester, so skeletal muscle has less active drug formation than liver. Lower intracellular cholesterol upregulates LDL receptors and increases plasma LDL clearance.",
