      nursingEssentials: ["Confirm baseline LDL, familial phenotype, concurrent lipid therapy, pregnancy/lactation context, injection schedule and ability to return at three and six-month intervals.", "Record the exact administration date and next due date; twice-yearly maintenance can fail operationally if ownership of recall and follow-up is unclear."],
